    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d13">

                <pb facs="0128" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg44"/>

                <head>No. 11.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation to the Argentine Republic</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1873-06-13"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            13, 1873</date>. (Received July 22.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 15.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    copy of the message of President Sarmiento to the Congress of this republic,
                    relative to the rebellion in the province of Entre Rios.</p>
                <p>I have not been able to obtain any official information, except what is contained
                    in this document, and an oral statement made to me by the secretary for foreign
                    affairs, that the insurrection was not considered formidable by the
                    government.</p>
                <p>So far as I am able to learn, no important engagement between the armed forces of
                    the insurgents and those of the government has occurred.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JULIUS WHITE.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d13-a1.xml" xpointer="d13-a1"/>
            </div>
